Description:
 sophomorix-belwue-mail - Reading external Mail data at Belwue and suggest actions
 sophomorix-developer - Test suite for sophomorix-samba
 sophomorix-dump - Migration dump script
 sophomorix-samba - Sophomorix for Samba 4
 sophomorix-vampire - Migration vampire script
Changes:
 sophomorix4 (7.4.6) lmn74; urgency=medium
 .
   * [sophomorix-device] AD_gpo_listall() no longer runs samba-tool gpo
     listcontainers for each GPO: its output was never read, and each
     call cost about 1.5 s on every run. Fix #190, reported by
     @Pasemesan.
   * [school.conf] New "manual" value for MAIL_LOCAL_PART_SCHEME: an
     existing mail address is no longer overwritten, new users and users
     without an address get their login name. MAIL_LOCAL_PART_MAP and
     MAILDOMAIN=NONE take precedence. Extends #188, reported by
     @hermanntoast.
